---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'What exactly is a fractional CTO?',
    a: "An experienced technology executive who works with your company part-time, typically a set number of days or hours a month, on a retainer. You get CTO-level strategy, leadership, and accountability without the cost or commitment of a full-time executive hire.",
  },
  {
    q: 'How much of your time do I get?',
    a: "It depends on the stage and the need. Most engagements run between one and three days a week, with flexibility for crunch periods. We'll scope it together after the intro call.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you work with my existing team or agency?',
    a: "Yes, that's most of the job. I lead and support your in-house engineers, contractors, or agency partners, and help you decide over time which mix makes sense.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you still write code?',
    a: "When it's the highest-leverage thing to do, yes: prototypes, critical fixes, proofs of concept, and code reviews. But the goal is a team that ships without depending on me.",
  },
  {
    q: 'How long do engagements last?',
    a: "Assessments run a few weeks. Fractional CTO retainers usually last six months or more, often until the company is ready for a full-time CTO. At that point I help define the role and run the search.",
  },
  {
    q: 'What does it cost?',
    a: "Pricing depends on scope and time commitment, and is a fraction of a full-time executive's salary, equity, and benefits. Book an intro call and I'll give you a straight number.",
  },
];
---

<section class="section" id="faq">
  <div class="container faq-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>faq</p>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>Questions people ask first.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faqs">
      {
        faqs.map((f) => (
          <details data-reveal>
            <summary>
              <span>{f.q}</span>
              <span class="icon mono" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <p>{f.a}</p>
          </details>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .faqs {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  summary {
    list-style: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 24px 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  summary:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .icon {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 20px;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  details[open] .icon {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  details p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding-bottom: 26px;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .faq-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
